    "narration": "Let's run our first experiment using the default settings: beta at 0.20, learning rate at 0.010, and 50 steps. Watch as the blue reward line climbs quickly at first, then levels off. The red KL penalty line drops below zero, showing the penalty growing as the model drifts. The green net objective rises and then plateaus, balancing reward and penalty.",
