  {
    "id": "20_vertex_cover_algo_code",
    "narration": "The pseudocode for the 2-approximation vertex cover algorithm is straightforward: while there are uncovered edges, pick one, add both endpoints to the cover, and remove all edges incident to those vertices. This greedy strategy is easy to implement and analyze.",
