  },
  {
    "id": "21_vertex_cover_analysis",
    "narration": "Comparing the exact and greedy solutions, we see that the greedy 2-approximation is always within a factor of two of the optimal. This is a powerful guarantee, especially for large graphs where finding the exact cover is computationally prohibitive.",
