  {
    "id": "22_algo_selector_tsp",
    "narration": "Next, let's turn to the Traveling Salesman Problem, or TSP. This classic challenge asks for the shortest possible tour that visits every city exactly once and returns to the starting point. We'll explore a 2-approximation algorithm based on minimum spanning trees.",
