    "id": "01_theory_what_is_rlhf",
    "narration": "Let's start by defining Reinforcement Learning from Human Feedback, or RLHF. Imagine we've trained a language model on vast amounts of internet text. While it's great at predicting the next word, that doesn't guarantee it will follow instructions helpfully or avoid producing harmful outputs. RLHF is a method for aligning a model's behavior with human preferences, using feedback from people rather than just maximizing likelihood.",
